filament-kmp (Erkko68) — Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/Erkko68/filament-kmp
  Binding Kotlin Multiplatform do Filament para Desktop/JVM, iOS e Web.
  Projeto comunitário, sem vínculo com o Google.

SceneView — Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/sceneview/sceneview
